Shaver came timely - still testing it;
Very disappointing as charger wasn't working from the first use (Good that we have Philips shop near and I've purchased new charger) can't tell that it shaves clean as a quality razor, but shaving every day is more effective than shaving every 2 or 3 days;
Let's see how long battery will last...

Bought this to replace my old Norelco 8000 series shaver whose battery died on me completely a year ago. I have lost a lot of hair since I had my original electric razor so I bought this to not only shave my beard but also my entire head. Needless to say, it did not disappoint.

Pros:
* good close shave (after a short week of adjustment);
* quiet motor;
* battery lasts long (just under a week) between charge cycles;
* quick charging (1.5 hrs for a full charge);
* no mess/collects cut hair in small reservoir;
* reservoir easy to clean;

Cons:
* not very portable (size wise) though much lighter than my old unit;
* wish case had a small pocket for the cleaning brush;

Bottom line, I'll definitely recommend this shaver (Philips Norelco 8240) to anyone who's looking for a good hassle-free shave.
